  {
   "id": "tinykin-152267@1.0.8",
   "gameId": "tinykin-152267",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 1.0.8",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-07T16:09:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello brave adventurers!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have seen so much amazing feedback since the official launch of Tinykin and have been working tirelessly to improve the game according to your comments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We are thrilled to announce that a MAJOR UPDATE (Version 1.0.8) is live now today in the game!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Without further ado, let’s take a look at what this update offers:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Quality of Life Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There's now a Tinykin counter implemented in the game that indicates how many Tinykins are yet to be found. If you’ve been wanting to get the Gotta Catch'em All! Achievement, this will be extremely helpful!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chrysal Workshop Button is implemented in the game to help Milo quickly get back to the main map where all rooms connect. This will be helpful when you want to get access to certain maps in a quicker/not manual way. It also helps when you get stuck/clipped in places and are unable to continue the game;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Widescreen support is now added to the game for you to change the resolutions natively.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed crashes occurring in Balnea, for AMD GPU users;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The broken achievement issues should be fixed now. If you have previously encountered completed achievement issues related to collections, please revisit each room in order to refresh the stats and unlock them;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chrysal Workshop button allows you to leave situations where previously getting soft-locked;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the settings issue where they would change back to default after setting them to Medium;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "More minor fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are continuing to apply more updates and changes into the game and constantly collecting your feedback so update the game now and let us know how that works for you! Thank you all for the kind support again and we look forward to discussing the changes with you in our community channels:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Instagram",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "TikTok",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the game adventurers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
